fixture pogo_bounce
doc BUILD.md s5 Pogo: "Bounce velocity 900 u/s" (tuned to 794 u/s: docs/feel_log/2026-10-17-pogo-bounce.md), "vertical replaced"
room test/spikes
spawn 800 300
frames 45
input
  0..16 -
  17..44 D attack
end
expect
  at 17 event.attack=1 action=down action_frame=1
  mark bounce 18..30 event.pogo=1
  # 794 u/s up is 3388 sub-pixels a frame, replacing the fall speed.
  at bounce vy=-3388 state=air action=none
  never 0..44 event.hazard=1
end
